      "writtenOn": "2022-11-17T20:40:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "khugepaged can also remove L1 page tables (but not L2 and higher page tables). That might not be a problem here, I\u0027m not sure...\n\nAnd mremap() can move L1 and L2 page tables to a new virtual address in a new VMA, which might mean that an attacker could use mremap() to move page tables into a new VMA while they\u0027re being traversed speculatively through the old VMA, then munmap() the *new* VMA to free the page tables while they\u0027re still being traversed?\n\nAlso, what if an SPF starts on VMA 1, then VMA 1 gets concurrently merged into VMA 2 via vma_merge(), and then the entire VMA 2 is munmap\u0027ed? Or if VMA 1 gets split into VMA 1 and VMA 2, and then VMA 2 is munmap\u0027ed? I think for this to work, you might have to add something like wait_for_vma_users() to the VMA merging/splitting paths.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 402,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 403,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "2ca8362e88faa2b7b6394e820f68df38cdeff8f5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "92563440_c2f3591d",
        "filename": "mm/memory.c",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 403,
      "author": {
        "id": 1157738
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-17T21:35:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In merging/splitting paths we have vm_write_begin/vm_write_end which would indicate that VMA was changed while SPF handling was going on, so it will fall back and retry with mmap_lock in read mode.\n\nI\u0027ll need to check about khugepaged(). Maybe we just bail out on huge pages. They are rarely used in Android anyway.\n\nmremap() does call move_page_tables() which can clear PMD and that\u0027s a similar problem to the one in free_pgtables, so I do need to add protection there as well.",
      "parentUuid": "744fcc46_3b70b859",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 402,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 403,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "2ca8362e88faa2b7b6394e820f68df38cdeff8f5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
